<https://w3id.org/plato#BeginsAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The subject segment begins at the target: a leg of an itinerary at the\n        station it leaves, a river reach at its upstream confluence. With\n        plato:EndsAt it gives a segment a direction. A segment with no\n        direction is joined to its two ends with plato:HasEnd.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#transcription_completeness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
