<https://w3id.org/plato#geo_json> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        GeoJSON representation of the geometry. Used for web mapping\n        applications and LPF export. Should be a valid GeoJSON geometry\n        object (not a Feature or FeatureCollection). Its datatype is\n        rdf:JSON, the JSON literal of JSON-LD 1.1: the JSON-LD context\n        maps the geojson key with @type @json, which is the only way a\n        GeoJSON object in a document can become a literal rather than\n        a node, so every converted dataset already carries rdf:JSON.\n        (Before 0.7.0 the range was given as xsd:string, which no\n        conversion produced.)\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#value_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
_:na519a30634a746a18aecd69d7dc797e5b22 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/plato#Timespan> .
