<https://w3id.org/plato#CertaintyLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A defined level of certainty for use in attestations, allowing\n        projects to standardise their confidence vocabulary. An attestation or\n        facet points at one with plato:certainty_level. PLATO declares the three\n        levels of Linked Places Format (plato:Certain, plato:LessCertain,\n        plato:Uncertain); a project may declare its own.\n    "@en .
