<https://w3id.org/plato#transcription_accuracy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#licence> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isReplacedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> .
