<https://w3id.org/plato#contributor_affiliation_string> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Free-text organizational affiliation when a structured Organization\n        entity is not available. Example: \"University of Pittsburgh,\n        Institute for Spatial History Innovation\"\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#Candidate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Candidate"@en .
