<https://w3id.org/plato#contributor_affiliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Organizational affiliation of the contributor. Links to a\n        plato:Organization entity, which can be further described using\n        FOAF, schema.org, or other ontology properties. Organizations\n        should ideally use persistent identifiers (ROR, ISNI, etc.).\n\n        For simple cases, use contributor_affiliation_string for free-text\n        affiliation names.\n    "@en .
