<https://w3id.org/plato#has_relation_type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the semantic type of a entity-to-entity relationship\n        attested by an Attestation. References a RelationType authority\n        which defines the relationship's label, inverse, and domain/range\n        constraints. Examples: 'capital_of', 'successor_to',\n        'connected_by_trade_route_to'.\n\n        The extensible vocabulary pattern allows new relationship types to\n        be added as Authority records without modifying the ontology.\n    "@en .
