<https://w3id.org/plato#Authority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Abstract superclass for all reference entities that provide provenance\n        or semantic grounding for attestations. Subtypes include Source,\n        Dataset, Period, RelationType, and CertaintyLevel.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#toponym> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The name string itself in its original script. This is the primary\n        property of a Name entity. Required for all Name instances.\n    "@en .
