<https://w3id.org/plato#duration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        How long the timespan lasted, as an xsd:duration ('P42D' for six\n        weeks, 'P1D' for a day), where the source states a length: a stay at\n        a stop on an itinerary, a siege, a fair. It may stand alone, when the\n        source gives a length and no dates, or beside the bounds, which it\n        does not replace. xsd:duration has no weeks, so weeks are written as\n        days; the source's own words ('staid 6 weekes') are\n        plato:source_label on the same timespan.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#Dataset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
