<https://w3id.org/plato#RelativeQualifierScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Starter concepts for plato:relative_qualifier. How a facet is defined relative to its anchor when bearing and distance are not applicable or not sufficient."@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#identity_certainty> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "identity certainty"@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#AlternativeTo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "alternative to"@en .
