<https://w3id.org/plato#cites> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The Authority (a Source or a Dataset) this Citation uses. Exactly one\n        per Citation: an attestation resting on two sources has two\n        Citations.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#BetweenXAndY> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "between"@en .
