<https://w3id.org/plato#period_periodo_uri> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Link to a PeriodO period definition for this Period authority.\n        When present, indicates this Period aligns with a standardized PeriodO\n        definition. The PeriodO record provides authoritative temporal bounds,\n        spatial extent, and cultural context. Example: 'https://n2t.net/ark:/99152/p06v8w4rb38'\n    "@en .
