<https://w3id.org/plato#contributor_role> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Role of the contributor in the project or gazetteer. Examples:\n        'principal_investigator', 'data_curator', 'student_researcher',\n        'automated_process', 'external_contributor'. Helps understand the\n        context and authority of contributions.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#periodo_uri> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "PeriodO URI"@en .
