<https://w3id.org/plato#Candidate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A match between two SpatialEntities suggested by software, for a\n        person to review: reconciliation against reference gazetteers (as in\n        WHG's Map your Data), record linkage, clustering. Candidates carry a\n        similarity score, the algorithm's version and, optionally, the\n        settings that produced the score (plato:match_parameters), and a\n        review status. They are explicitly not\n        IdentityRelations — they become IdentityRelations only when confirmed\n        by a human reviewer (linked back via plato:promoted_from).\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#related_label> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "related label"@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#ContainedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#modified> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#candidate_status> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "status"@en .
