<https://w3id.org/plato#namespace> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Whose identifier plato:entity_identifier is (e.g. 'geonames', 'wikidata',\n        'tgn', 'osm', 'pleiades', 'whg', or the contributing project's own short\n        name). Authority-sourced SpatialEntities carry their origin namespace;\n        contributed SpatialEntities that cannot be linked to any authority\n        receive the 'whg' namespace.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#SubjectOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The target is about the subject: an archival file, a site record, a report or a publication, identified by its address. Not a citation of the target as evidence for another statement, which is plato:has_citation."@en .
