<https://w3id.org/plato#HasEnd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The subject segment has the target as one of its ends, in no\n        particular direction: a stretch of road between two towns, walked\n        either way. An undirected segment has two HasEnd attestations. Not\n        plato:ConnectedTo, which joins two places directly: were a segment\n        connected to its ends, every place would be two steps from its\n        neighbours.\n    "@en .
