<https://w3id.org/plato#universe> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The figure this figure is a part or share of: its denominator, where\n        the source defines one. Asserted only from the source, never inferred\n        from labels or sums: in Vision of Ireland three of seven plausible\n        denominators by name are wrong. The occupied beside the\n        total of the same row, or Vision of Ireland's Total Population cube as\n        the universe of the others for the same unit and year. RDF Data Cube\n        has no such property, and without it which number is the denominator\n        of which is lost, unrecoverably once the table is gone.\n    "@en .
