<https://w3id.org/plato#TypeRoute> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An ordered set of places making a way: a road, a sea lane, a pilgrimage route. Its timespan, if any, is when it was in use, not when anyone travelled it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#BetweenXAndY> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
