<https://w3id.org/plato#TypeNetwork> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A set of places and the connections between them, in no single order: a river system, a canal network, a correspondence network."@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#Normalised> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
