<https://w3id.org/plato#EntityKindScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Starter concepts for the kinds of SpatialEntity a platform treats specially: routes, itineraries, networks and segments. A Type attestation names one in its type identifier."@en .
