<https://w3id.org/plato#attests_about> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/plato#SpatialEntity> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#TranscriptionFalse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#has_timespan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/plato#Period> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#end_precision> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Temporal granularity of the end bound. Values: 'day', 'month',\n        'year', 'decade', 'century', 'era', 'geological_period'.\n    "@en .
