<https://w3id.org/plato#contributor_url> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Website or profile URL for the contributor (personal website,\n        institutional page, project page, GitHub profile, etc.). Provides\n        additional context about the contributor's work and identity.\n    "@en .
