<https://w3id.org/plato#open_end> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Boolean flag indicating that the end of this interval is deliberately\n        unspecified (not merely unknown). True for ongoing periods like 'Modern\n        era (1800-present)' or situations where the end does not exist. Aligns\n        with PeriodO's OpenEndInterval.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#attests_name> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Links an Attestation to a Name it asserts for the SpatialEntity. An attestation\n        may assert multiple names (e.g., primary name and variants) or no name\n        at all (e.g., geometry-only attestations).\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#attests_name> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/plato#Attestation> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#authority_uri> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "authority URI"@en .
