<https://w3id.org/plato#InFieldName> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "in field name"@en .
_:na519a30634a746a18aecd69d7dc797e5b12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/plato#Type> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#Citation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        One attestation's use of one Authority: the qualified form of\n        plato:sourced_by. Carries what is true of this citation rather than\n        of the source or of the attestation: the locator within the work\n        (page, folio, column, table cell, entry), and whether the attribution\n        was stated in the source or inferred editorially. It carries no date.\n        The date of a witness belongs on the Source (plato:source_timespan)\n        and the date of the claim on the Attestation's Timespan.\n\n        An attestation resting on several sources has several Citations,\n        each with its own locator. Where there is nothing to say about the\n        citation, plato:sourced_by alone is sufficient.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#identity_asserted_at> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#repr_point> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "representative point"@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#StanceAsserted> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "asserted"@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#romanized> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/plato#Name> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#contributor_identifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Additional persistent identifier for the contributor. Can be used\n        for identifiers other than ORCID, such as:\n        - ISNI (International Standard Name Identifier)\n        - VIAF (Virtual International Authority File)\n        - Wikidata QID (for persons or organizations)\n        - Internal system identifiers\n\n        When using this property, specify the identifier type in the value\n        (e.g., \"ISNI:0000000121032683\" or \"VIAF:12345678\").\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#ConnectedTo> <https://w3id.org/plato#relation_range> "SpatialEntity" .
