<https://w3id.org/plato#CertaintyLevel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#StanceTentative> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/plato> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#broader_relation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The more general RelationType of which this one is a narrower case:\n        a project's 'flows into' has broader_relation plato:LeadsTo, so any\n        attestation of the one is also, for a consumer that follows this\n        link, an attestation of the other. A narrower type keeps the\n        direction of its broader one. Transitive in use: a consumer should\n        follow the chain to the starter type it knows.\n    "@en .
