<https://w3id.org/plato#transcription_completeness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Whether a transcribed value is whole: a concept in\n        plato:TranscriptionCompletenessScheme, plato:TranscriptionComplete,\n        plato:TranscriptionReconstructable (part is lost but can be supplied\n        with confidence) or plato:TranscriptionNonReconstructable (part is lost\n        and cannot be supplied). A different axis from accuracy: a damaged form\n        can be accurately read as far as it goes. No rdfs:domain, as for\n        accuracy.\n    "@en .
