<https://w3id.org/plato#attests_timespan> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Links an Attestation to the Timespan during which the attested\n        properties (name, geometry, type) were applicable. Distinct from\n        the attestation's creation date: this is the historical timespan\n        being asserted, not when the assertion was made. It is no wider than\n        the source can witness: a source that shows a name in use only in its\n        own day (a letter, a survey, a gazetteer consulted now) supports a\n        timespan of that day, so the attested timespan then coincides with\n        the source's own date (plato:source_timespan), while remaining the\n        claim's.\n    "@en .
