<https://w3id.org/plato#contributed_by> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The agent (person, team, or process) who created this attestation.\n\n        Semantically equivalent to PROV-O's prov:wasAttributedTo for provenance\n        tracking. We don't use formal rdfs:subPropertyOf to avoid importing\n        PROV-O's domain/range constraints. Distinct from sourced_by, which\n        indicates the historical source being cited.\n    "@en .
